  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "284e53dc-d063-49ff-8783-542ff0acf260",
    "name": "📌 Celeris API ⚡",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Celeris is an AI research lab building frontier language models with ultra-low latency for voice, agents, and real-time AI applications.\"\n\nCeleris builds its own diffusion language models, which refine many output tokens in parallel, and serves them through an OpenAI-compatible API with Chat, Responses and System One decisions. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Celeris Account: [https://celeris.ai/](https://celeris.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `celeris_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:celeris_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\nThe model name is part of the URL (`{{baseUrl}}/<model>/v1/...`) and must match the `model` field in the body.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.celeris.ai/api-reference](https://docs.celeris.ai/api-reference)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.celeris.ai/models](https://docs.celeris.ai/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
